Package: awto-webshare
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-aiohttp, openssl, libpam0g
Description: simple web file browser for TrueNAS WebShare
 Serves the shares in middleware's rendered /etc/webshare/config.json on port 755
 (HTTPS), PAM service `webshare`, group `truenas_webshare`. File I/O runs as the
 logged-in user. Clean-room: no TrueNAS closed code.
